<title>GREECE: NICKOS KASTRIOTIS GOES TO P&amp;K SECURITIES.</title>
<headline>NICKOS KASTRIOTIS GOES TO P&amp;K SECURITIES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nickos Kastriotis, formerly a member of the institutional sales team at M.Kyranis Securities, has moved to P&amp;K Securities headed by Lambros Papakonstandinou and Achileas Kontoyouris, market sources said.</p>
<p>Kastriotis will head the institutional sales team at P&amp;K Securities, they said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
